{"id":"9b48ca7c5c96f8c5","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-independent-set.md","title":"INDEPENDENT-SET","display":"df-independent-set — INDEPENDENT-SET","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-independent-set","aliases":["28-df-independent-set","INDEPENDENT-SET"],"display":"df-independent-set — INDEPENDENT-SET","depends_on":["[[28-df-finite-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-independent-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-independent-set</span><span>INDEPENDENT-SET</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-independent-set — INDEPENDENT-SET"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span> 与图及非负整数阈值的编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}\\)</span> 由下式指定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ k\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ k\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IS}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\ \\middle|\\\nG=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;\\left(|S|\\ge k\\land\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\ne v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\notin E)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IS}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\ \\middle|\\\nG=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;\\left(|S|\\ge k\\land\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\ne v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\notin E)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本目录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IS}\">\\(\\mathrm{IS}\\)</span> 对应书中的 INDSET；“至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>”与“存在恰 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个顶点的独立集”等价。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 总可由空集见证。</p>\n<p>来源核对：例2.2、定理2.15；印刷39、51页；PDF65、77页。定义与名称对应已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-finite-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UGraph}$ 与图及非负整数阈值的编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]；$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}$ 由下式指定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{UGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ k\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IS}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\ \\middle|\\\nG=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;\\left(|S|\\ge k\\land\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\ne v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\notin E)\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IS}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false}],"bytes":1159,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"图问题：[[28-df-finite-graph]]、[[28-df-clique]]、[[28-df-vertex-cover]]、[[28-df-independent-set]]、[[28-df-hamiltonian-cycle]]、[[28-df-graph-coloring]]、[[28-df-set-cover]]。"},{"id":"a93b83e8c9de9da6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b5b8f3d84579602d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["dada5c223e508373"]}